pub const LOYALTY_LEDGER_SUPPLIES : str = "the bonus ledger a referral credit was a row in until 2026-09-26, and the finding that the balance movements that pair with a ledger insert are a subset of all of them (six of ten when this was written; three of seven since R3 removed this domain's three). All three of this domain's credits were inside that six, and that owner named all three by path and line into src/. This file adds no ledger column and no replay key. Re-checked 2026-09-21: that owner's LEDGER_BYPASS_SITES names four bypasses and not one of them is a referral site; re-checked 2026-09-26: this domain writes no balance at all, so it is in neither list.";

; The agreement above, pinned so it cannot drift silently. turbobaby/loyalty-ledger declared the
; same three sites from its side and names this contract back by ID; neither file cites the
; other by line number, in either direction. If that owner's bypass list ever grows a referral
; site, these literals and his disagree and the invariant below fails. R3 (2026-09-26) removed
; this domain's three paired credits: seven movements are left, three of them paired, and none is
; this domain's. The readings before it are kept under their _BEFORE_2026_09_26 names.
pub const LEDGER_PAIRED_MOVEMENTS : u8 = 3;
pub const LEDGER_MOVEMENTS_TOTAL : u8 = 7;
pub const THIS_DOMAINS_CREDITS_INSIDE_THE_PAIRED_SIX : u8 = 0;
